#: data/maps/Route104_MrBrineysHouse/scripts.inc:97
msgctxt "Route104_MrBrineysHouse_Text_WaitUpPeeko"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Hold on, lass!\n"
"Wait up, PEEKO!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route104_MrBrineysHouse/scripts.inc:101
msgctxt "Route104_MrBrineysHouse_Text_ItsYouLetsSailToDewford"
msgid ""
"Hm? You're {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"You saved my darling PEEKO!\l"
"We owe so much to you!\p"
"What's that?\n"
"You want to sail with me?\p"
"Hmhm…\p"
"You have a LETTER bound for DEWFORD\n"
"and a package for SLATEPORT, then?\p"
"Quite the busy life you must lead!\p"
"But, certainly, what you're asking is\n"
"no problem at all.\p"
"You've come to the right man!\n"
"We'll set sail for DEWFORD.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route104_MrBrineysHouse/scripts.inc:116
msgctxt "Route104_MrBrineysHouse_Text_SetSailForDewford"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: DEWFORD it is, then!\p"
"Anchors aweigh!\n"
"PEEKO, we're setting sail, my darling!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route104_MrBrineysHouse/scripts.inc:121
msgctxt "Route104_MrBrineysHouse_Text_DeclineDeliverySail"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Is that so?\n"
"Your deliveries can wait?\p"
"You just go on and tell me whenever\n"
"you want to set sail!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route104_MrBrineysHouse/scripts.inc:127
msgctxt "Route104_MrBrineysHouse_Text_NeedToMakeDeliveriesSailToDewford"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Ahoy!\n"
"I know exactly what you want to say!\p"
"You're to deliver a LETTER to DEWFORD\n"
"and a package to SLATEPORT.\p"
"What you need me to do is no problem\n"
"at all--I'm the man for the job!\p"
"First, we'll set sail for DEWFORD.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route104_MrBrineysHouse/scripts.inc:136
msgctxt "Route104_MrBrineysHouse_Text_NeedToDeliverPackageSailToDewford"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Ahoy!\n"
"I know exactly what you want to say!\p"
"You're to deliver a package to\n"
"CAPT. STERN in SLATEPORT.\p"
"What you need me to do is no problem\n"
"at all--I'm the man for the job!\p"
"First, we'll set sail for DEWFORD.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route104_MrBrineysHouse/scripts.inc:145
msgctxt "Route104_MrBrineysHouse_Text_WhereAreWeBound"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Ahoy!\n"
"For you, I'll go out to sea anytime!\p"
"Now, my friend, where are we bound?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route104_MrBrineysHouse/scripts.inc:150
msgctxt "Route104_MrBrineysHouse_Text_TellMeWheneverYouWantToSail"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Is that so?\n"
"Well, PEEKO owes her life to you.\p"
"You just go on and tell me whenever\n"
"you want to set sail!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route104_MrBrineysHouse/scripts.inc:156
msgctxt "Route104_MrBrineysHouse_Text_Peeko"
msgid "PEEKO: Pii piihyoro!$"
msgstr ""
